  m_text: 'FIGHT TOGETHER TO REACH THE HIGHEST WAVE POSSIBLE.


    ACCUMULATE AS
    MUCH SCORE AS YOU CAN WITH YOUR ALLIES.


    THE WAVES OF ENEMIES WILL NEVER
    STOP SO FIGHT AS LONG AS YOU CAN.


    EACH CHARACTER HAS UNIQUE WEAPONS AND
    ABILITIES TO HELP FIGHT THE HORDE OF ENEMIES.


    THEY FIGHT DOESNT END UNTIL
    EVERYONE IS DEFEATED.


    YOU ALLIES CAN REVIVE YOU BY GOING TO YOUR CORRESPONDING
    DEATH CIRCLE WHEN YOU DIE.


'
